title: "Benchmark1d2d — Open V&V Benchmarks for Hydraulic Solvers"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: OpenHydro
    given-names: Contributors
    alias: "@Scott"
