abstract: >-
  An open, engine-agnostic suite for verifying and validating 1D, 2D and
  coupled 1D/2D hydraulic solvers against exact solutions, laboratory
  measurements and the EPA SWMM / EPANET reference engines.
keywords:
  - verification
  - validation
  - SWMM
  - EPANET
  - shallow water
  - hydraulics
  - benchmark
